  --- n=3: d=1 fixed cells (apex (n,1) always present) ---
    (a,b)=(3,1)  pin(r,c)=(1,1)  span=2  | APEX: arc between extreme vertices n and 1 (source<->sink); span n-1

  --- n=4: d=1 fixed cells (apex (n,1) always present) ---
    (a,b)=(4,1)  pin(r,c)=(2,1)  span=3  | APEX: arc between extreme vertices n and 1 (source<->sink); span n-1

  --- n=5: d=2 fixed cells (apex (n,1) always present) ---
